<figure class="diagram-figure">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 680 340" role="img" aria-labelledby="transform-diagram-title transform-diagram-desc">
    <title id="transform-diagram-title">Transformasi vektor oleh matriks</title>
    <desc id="transform-diagram-desc">
      Sebuah vektor diputar sembilan puluh derajat searah jarum jam. Panjang vektor tetap,
      tetapi arahnya berubah.
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker id="transform-arrow-before" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" fill="var(--color-vector-a)" />
      </marker>
      <marker id="transform-arrow-after" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" fill="var(--color-vector-result)" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <rect width="680" height="340" fill="var(--color-surface)" rx="12" />

    <g transform="translate(20 0)">
      <text x="120" y="42" class="diagram-label">Sebelum</text>
      <line x1="70" y1="270" x2="300" y2="270" stroke="var(--color-axis)" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <line x1="70" y1="270" x2="70" y2="70" stroke="var(--color-axis)" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <line x1="70" y1="270" x2="230" y2="190" stroke="var(--color-vector-a)" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#transform-arrow-before)" />
      <text x="242" y="188" class="diagram-label diagram-label--a">v</text>
      <text x="285" y="292" class="diagram-axis">x</text>
      <text x="52" y="80" class="diagram-axis">y</text>
      <text x="54" y="292" class="diagram-axis">O</text>
    </g>

    <line x1="355" y1="160" x2="390" y2="160" stroke="var(--color-border-strong)" stroke-width="2" />
    <path d="m380 150 10 10-10 10" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-border-strong)" stroke-width="2" />

    <g transform="translate(340 0)">
      <text x="150" y="42" class="diagram-label">Sesudah rotasi 90°</text>
      <line x1="70" y1="270" x2="300" y2="270" stroke="var(--color-axis)" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <line x1="70" y1="270" x2="70" y2="70" stroke="var(--color-axis)" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <line x1="70" y1="270" x2="150" y2="110" stroke="var(--color-vector-result)" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#transform-arrow-after)" />
      <text x="158" y="108" class="diagram-label diagram-label--result">T(v)</text>
      <text x="285" y="292" class="diagram-axis">x</text>
      <text x="52" y="80" class="diagram-axis">y</text>
      <text x="54" y="292" class="diagram-axis">O</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    Matriks rotasi mengubah arah vektor tanpa mengubah panjangnya. Urutan transformasi dan
    perkalian matriks menentukan hasil akhir.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
